Tutorial

The Rating on the planet / in a bar should still be present and still send you to the local fisherman fleet.

Once you interact with the fleet, the fisherman should still provide the Tutorial:
Tutorial goes
Sent by source ->
Interact with fleet ->
get tutorial ecnounter and be given ROD / LINE (same ability) ->
Sent to local fishing pond to get one fish ->
Return, get explanation of LINE drones. Get explanation of what fish are (patterns assumed by the ghosts). ->
Get sent to another system close to the core with lower stability to get another fish ->
Fisherman is present there, as well, and, when asked, doesn't really explain ->
you bring him the fish and unlock the upgrade shop (NO entries for equipment you do not have! This means no entries for the Harpoon and the Breach Lights yet, neither upgrade nor tackle!) ->
Once you bring the second fish, you get the harpoon and breach lights, an explanation on what they are, how to use them, and the third quest: Catch a fish with the breach lights & Harpoon, again, golden quest fish.
Bring it to unlock the remaining entries in the shop and unlock the next quest ->
You get two survey data entries of common fish for free, an explanation on what survey data is and how it works.
You get a quest to bring back both of these fish. You also get an explanation of the fishing planner in the map section, because since there are now multiple targets, you should plan that trip properly. ->
Once you bring those two back, you get rewarded with the survey purchasing screen being unlocked and four free additional surveys, two common, one uncommon, one rare.

